00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:53.370
Chapter 24 Iron

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:06.410
♪ Oh, se kan you shii?! ♪

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:11.620
♪ Bai za dan ari ran! ♪

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:14.780
♪ Wa proud we! ♪

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:20.960
Mister.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:24.790
♪ Ada warii last dreamin'! ♪

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.790
I'm talking to you, Mister!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.500
The ocean sure is vast!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.750
Hey, Iron-boy!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.880
So this is where ya been.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.830
What are you talking about, Mister?

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.380
And besides, where the heck are we?

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:39.250
Don't ya know?

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.500
This here's a warship!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.640
We're goin' out sailin' into
the big wide world now!

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:49.410
How 'bout it?! Come with me on
this ship to visit foreign countries!

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.910
The world's a big place!

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.650
How 'bout we trade
with America and England,

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.200
and change Japan from
bein' behind the times?

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.870
I know!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:07.330
Ya can join the Kaientai, too!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.450
Yeah! That'd be good!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:17.620
Can't say I approve. Are ya still
up to doin' those kinds of things?

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:21.290
Ya can hate each other, and ya
can try to wash blood with blood,

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:24.250
but ya can't stop the changin' times.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:27.970
Ya oughta become more
like the Peacemaker and...

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.330
Hey! Peacemaker!

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.550
Dad?

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:41.760
Been a long time since you've
seen yer father, hasn't it?

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.430
Tetsunosuke.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.410
Dad...

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:05.000
You've grown heavier.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.120
I...

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.900
Dad, what should I...?

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:21.650
Well, I'm so glad to see
that you've grown up, Tetsu.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.140
So, Dad!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:37.500
Tetsu, you follow the
path that you believe in.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.750
Don't get caught up in the trivial things.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.780
Just master the truth within yourself.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.500
Become a Peacemaker.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:53.040
Dad...

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:57.880
Dad!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.830
Iron-boy.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.580
"Peace" is harmony.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:26.370
"Maker" is someone who creates.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:31.370
Someone who creates harmony...

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:06.200
But man, you guys sure did good!

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.120
You raided the place with just seven men,

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.390
and you bagged all those anti-Shogunate
bastards in one fell swoop!

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.080
I wish I could've gone on a rampage too!

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.700
You're making a racket.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:18.690
Soji's not fully recovered
yet, so keep it quiet.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.150
Oh...

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.330
I'm perfectly fine.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.400
By the way, aren't you going
to the Gion Festival today?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.830
What?

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.080
The Gion Festival? They're doing it?

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.500
That's what I heard.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.370
The citizens of Kyoto are
a pretty tough bunch.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.290
There's supposed to be
fireworks at night, too.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.000
Fireworks, huh?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.000
Brings back memories.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.380
Remember how we often used to
watch from the roof of Shiei Hall?

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.620
That's right!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.800
The fireworks in Edo sure
were grand, weren't they?!

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.640
All right!!

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:53.300
Let's kick back on the rooftop and
have a drink, just like the old days!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.100
I'm going to say no to that.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:57.020
Vice Commander!!

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.140
Oh, Mr. Hijikata.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:02.410
Huh? What? Why is that a no?!
What?! Why?!

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:04.060
He's saying we can't go up on the roof!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:08.040
But we did it all the time at Shiei Hall
when there was a festival going on!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:11.040
Sano, for goodness' sake, act your age!

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:14.780
This is no time to be getting excited
over a festival in the first place!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:20.080
The anti-Shogunate faction is
going to be seething over this.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.330
There's no way Choshu and the
others are going to stay quiet about it.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.330
Worse comes to worst,

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.210
they might spring a sneak
attack on us at Headquarters.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.250
Oh, I can't believe myself!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.250
Well, sure, but we wanna watch, too!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:31.000
I forgot to ask where the fireworks were!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:31.000
Right, Heisuke?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.590
You bastards have some nerve.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.580
What? Don't ask me! I don't know!

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.200
It'll be fine, Mr. Hijikata.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.250
If it came down to it,
we could just fight like this.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.410
And if we can't get back to Headquarters,

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.770
we can just kick everyone
aside from the outside.

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:46.870
We managed to do all right at Ikedaya, too.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.610
Besides, we're strong!

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.300
I'm sure it'll work out somehow.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.530
Make sure you stay somewhere
where you can be contacted easily.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.950
Woohoo!!

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.580
Mr. Hijikata, you're the man!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.660
Soji, we'll bring something back for you!

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:04.250
You sure about this? It's not like
Mr. Hijikata, like it's kind of creepy...

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.630
Okay, everyone, we're off!

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.790
I guess even the great Mr. Hijikata

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:14.180
doesn't stand a chance against
all three of them together.

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:18.290
I swear, those guys couldn't have
been louder in a sick man's room.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:21.040
I keep telling you that I am not sick!

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.690
The blood splatter got into
my throat and I choked on it!

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:27.060
Yeah, all right, all right.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:32.570
Vice Commander!

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:34.400
Shall I make some tea?!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.570
I don't want any!

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.790
The tea you make tastes like crap.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.910
I won't drink it unless
I'm extremely thirsty.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.210
And stop asking every other chance you get!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.290
You trying to make me all bloated?

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.660
Well, we will be excusing
ourselves as well.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:55.590
All right.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:59.350
Please go have plenty
of fun at the festival.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.810
You know...

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.500
You don't have to push your health

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.360
and go out of your way to be
so amiable even around them.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.080
I'm really fine!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.410
I've stopped coughing already,

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:18.570
and even with my chest, it turned out
none of the bones were broken.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.500
Oh, well...

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.090
I was just thinking that he's
turned into such an adorable page.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.200
He's just annoying.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:42.370
Susumu, why're you inviting Tatsu along?

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.370
What does it matter?

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:46.100
After all the worry you put him through,

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.040
if you go gallivanting off
without letting him know again,

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.750
your big brother'll die of worry.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:51.740
Tetsunosuke.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:56.830
Mr. Saito, please don't scare me like that!

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:59.240
Your shadow...

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.330
It seems it has finally disappeared.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.290
Hey, there, Tetsunosuke.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.270
Do you have a minute?

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.300
Mr. Yamanami, how are you feeling?

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:20.090
I'm much better now, thanks for asking.

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:38.330
Eisuke Okuzawa

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:44.200
I didn't participate in
yesterday's funeral service.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.750
He may be angry,
wondering why a Vice Commander

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:53.790
who didn't even join in the
raid is coming to see him now.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:01.830
Sorry for dragging you out here
with me when I know you must be busy.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.750
Now, shall we go?

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.620
Yes, sir.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:12.600
Mr. Yamanami?

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:18.040
I'm really glad that you didn't die.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:21.000
You don't have to worry about me.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.610
You go on ahead.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.410
Mr. Yamanami...

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.080
Reporting in, sir.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.580
Of the survivors of Ikedaya,

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:37.580
it appears several took refuge
in the Choshu Clan House.

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:40.330
The flags and hanging screens
that we seized from Tanbaya

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:43.080
have all been transported
to Aizu's main camp.

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:46.160
All right, good work.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.200
Get some rest in preparation for tomorrow.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:48.840
Yes, sir.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.330
Say, Toshi,

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:55.200
we've received a bounty of
600 ryo from Lord Matsudaira

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:58.660
and 100 ryo in recognition of
our work from the Imperial Court.

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:02.820
It means even the Lord has recognized
the Shinsengumi's good deeds.

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:08.790
So, how about we have a
quiet little party of our own?

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:45.450
Susumu! Tatsu!

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.530
Come on, hurry up!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.540
Tatsu! Tatsu!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.820
Here! Over here!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.700
You were really good at it when
you did it that one time, remember?

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:59.550
Let me see you do it again!

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:05.530
No, I'll pass.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:19.910
You two, wait here for a bit.

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:21.750
Here for a bit?

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.580
Wait! Tetsu!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.650
Hey!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:27.960
Tetsu...

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.120
I can't wait.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.250
I know.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.580
I heard they're doing fireworks.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:37.290
Yes, that's right...

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:47.550
So? What's this about?

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:53.600
About what I did the day
before yesterday... I am really...

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:58.350
very sorry.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:03.820
Hearing you address me so politely
at this late date only creeps me out.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:07.700
Poor kid.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:11.540
Everyone around him is praising him,

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.120
saying he did an admirable
job overcoming it all,

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.250
but because his big
brother's such a worrier,

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:19.960
he's feeling like he's
done something wrong.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.710
When you're looking at me like that,

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:25.020
just how am I supposed to respond?

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.500
It's not like...

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:32.540
It's not like I'm angry or anything.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.330
No one said anything about being angry.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:42.730
I'm really happy that he...
that Tetsu was able to recover.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.250
Just that...

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:47.910
You're greatly against him
taking up the sword, is that it?

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:50.000
Don't worry.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:50.860
Or rather...

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:53.830
Too bad for you.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:58.660
He's not as weak as you wish he'd be.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.410
Who would wish...?

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.160
Am I wrong?

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:07.410
No, I don't expect you to understand.

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:10.540
A lot has gone on between
my brother and me, after all.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:13.040
Don't even want to understand, honestly.

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:15.700
But...

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:17.660
While I can't understand you,

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:18.960
I'll make peace with you.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:24.610
Even if it's a bit warped,
he's fortunate to be loved, after all.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:29.540
Huh? Well...

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.700
But this is all so sudden...

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:34.620
Oh-ho, still not satisfied?

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.910
I don't mind.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.040
Protracted hostilities
are right up my alley.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:39.960
My stomach...

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.580
What're you doing?

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.670
Huh? What you should be sticking
out is your left cheek.

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.510
Is that the so-called payback?

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:54.640
Well, you ought to be a tad more
upstanding as the big brother.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.470
But, you had your guard up!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:01.100
Oh, then it's just a matter of
blocking my punch yourself.

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:04.040
Wait! That's not...

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.490
Excuse me!

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:26.250
<i>Saya...</i>

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:33.260
Forgive me, Osaya, Ohana.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.290
For getting sick at a time like this.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.370
If it weren't for me,

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:43.020
you could have gone to see the
festival floats with that puppy boy.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:47.400
You must have wanted to at least go out
today and walk with the one you love.

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.160
Sister Akesato, you've got
yourself to worry about already.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:53.900
You don't have to be so concerned for us!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.700
I know! Would you like something to eat?

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.660
Shall I go buy something from out there?

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:07.250
I'll go take a quick look around.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.290
I'm very sorry,

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:13.000
but Akesato has become ill,
and she's been charged with her care.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.470
But it's only to go see the
festival floats together for a bit.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.550
Tetsunosuke...

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.510
I cannot allow it.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.720
Man, talk about stingy.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.370
What should I do?

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:27.650
I know!

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.580
She could at least let me see her!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:33.040
So stingy!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.650
Hurry! This way!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.870
Oh, Tetsunosuke!

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:51.340
Huh? What?

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:55.880
Saya...

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.040
So, well...

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:02.540
sorry for dropping by so suddenly.

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:05.950
I thought we could go see
the festival floats together,

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:08.440
but the person here said no.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:13.620
I heard you can't go out because
you're caring for Miss Akesato?

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:15.950
I'll buy you some kind of souvenir.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:19.200
Um, see? They're selling
weird masks like this one.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.040
I know! You like candied
apples too, don't you?

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.480
Oh, this?

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:31.040
It's not really that serious.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.250
It just got cut a little.

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:38.470
The doctor said it'll
grow back together, so...

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.330
It'll be okay.

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:56.030
I'm happy for you, Saya.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:06.300
I can't ever see Suzu again.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.640
I'll promise you.

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:16.800
I may draw a sword...

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:20.680
but I'll never...

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.430
ever...

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.160
kill anyone.

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:52.920
♪ Cross my heart, hope to die,
stick a needle in my eye... ♪

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:59.660
Excellent fireworks!

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:01.340
It's been a while, hasn't it?

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:04.090
Not too shabby, I suppose.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:07.620
But are you sure you should be doing this?

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:11.000
You told Mr. Harada and
the others that they couldn't.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.290
You idiot!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.100
We wouldn't have anywhere to sit otherwise.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:18.410
That's so like you, Toshi.
You haven't changed one bit.

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:22.160
Shut up. Let me kick back
and relax once in a while.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.200
Tatsu!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.330
Sorry.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.440
Tetsu...

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.310
Master...

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:16.830
Susumu! Tatsu!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.170
You guys are slow!
The fireworks are going to start!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.870
What's the big deal?

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:24.010
We'll be able to see the fireworks
no matter where we are.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.540
Shut up!

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:28.010
I want to see them from
the rooftop of Headquarters!

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:32.270
Wanting to get up on high places
just proves you're a brat.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.910
Oh?

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.210
Haven't you grown a bit taller?

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:54.410
What?

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:08.580
<i>Maiku o nigirishime
hitto pareedo no onpareedo</i>

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:12.120
<i>Hey, Jimmy, kibun wa doudai?</i>

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:16.500
<i>Suteeji orireba sasuga no jentoruman</i>

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:20.160
<i>Hey, Jimmy, kokoro mo kandai!</i>

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:24.190
<i>Jimichi ga yue ni seikatsu sae mo jimi ni</i>

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:28.000
<i>Kotsu-kotsu tsumiagemashou</i>

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:32.000
<i>Jimichi ni yume ga kanaimasu you ni</i>

00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Kyou mo, Jimmy, ikimashou</i>

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:41.370
